description: Guardrails for AI-assisted product features (suggestions, explanations, anomaly hints, natural-language search) - use when building or changing anything that calls a language model
globs: libs/api/ai/**, **/ai/**, **/*llm*.ts, **/*prompt*.ts
alwaysApply: false
